    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../web/server/WebServer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.web.server\"><code>WebServer</code></a> that can be used to control a Tomcat web server. Usually this class\nshould be created using the <a href=\"reactive/TomcatReactiveWebServerFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.tomcat.reactive\"><code>TomcatReactiveWebServerFactory</code></a> or\n<a href=\"servlet/TomcatServletWebServerFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.tomcat.servlet\"><code>TomcatServletWebServerFactory</code></a>, but not directly.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../web/server/WebServer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.web.server\"><code>WebServer</code></a> 可用于控制 Tomcat Web 服务器。通常，应使用 <a href=\"reactive/TomcatReactiveWebServerFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.tomcat.reactive\"><code>TomcatReactiveWebServerFactory</code></a> 或 <a href=\"servlet/TomcatServletWebServerFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.tomcat.servlet\"><code>TomcatServletWebServerFactory</code></a> 来创建该类，而不是直接创建。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
